                "message": {
                    "content": "```php\n<?php\n$line = trim(fgets(STDIN));\n$parts = preg_split('/\\s+/', $line);\n$n = (int)$parts[0];\n$k = $parts[1]; // keep as string for bcmath precision\n\n// f[i] = number of involutions of size i\n$f = array_fill(0, $n + 1, \"0\");\n$f[0] = \"1\";\nif ($n >= 1) $f[1] = \"1\";\nfor ($i = 2; $i <= $n; $i++) {\n    $f[$i] = bcadd($f[$i - 1], bcmul((string)($i - 1), $f[$i - 2]));\n}\n\n$unused = range(1, $n);\n$result = array_fill(1, $n, 0);\n\nwhile (count($unused) > 0) {\n    sort($unused);\n    $m = $unused[0];\n    $size = count($unused);\n    $count1 = $f[$size - 1];\n    \n    if (bccomp($k, $count1) <= 0) {\n        $result[$m] = $m;\n        $idx = array_search($m, $unused);\n        array_splice($unused, $idx, 1);\n        continue;\n    } else {\n        $k = bcsub($k, $count1);\n        $count2 = ($size - 2 >= 0) ? $f[$size - 2] : \"0\";\n        \n        $others = [];\n        foreach ($unused as $x) {\n            if ($x != $m) $others[] = $x;\n        }\n        sort($others);\n        \n        foreach ($others as $v) {\n            if (bccomp($k, $count2) <= 0) {\n                $result[$m] = $v;\n                $result[$v] = $m;\n                $newUnused = [];\n                foreach ($unused as $x) {\n                    if ($x != $m && $x != $v) $newUnused[] = $x;\n                }\n                $unused = $newUnused;\n                break;\n            } else {\n                $k = bcsub($k, $count2);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n$out = [];\nfor ($i = 1; $i <= $n; $i++) {\n    $out[] = $result[$i];\n}\necho implode(' ', $out) . \"\\n\";\n?>\n```",
